==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From the Old Norse [[bera#Old Norse|bera]].

===Verb===
'''bera'''

# to [[carry]], to [[bear]]
# {{impersonal|lang=is}} to be [[obligated]] to do something, denoting a sense of duty
#: ''Mér ber að fara í stríð.''
#:: I '''am obligated''' to go to [[war]].

====Derived terms====
* [[bera kápuna á báðum öxlum]]
* [[berast]]
* [[aðalborinn]]

[[Category:Icelandic verbs]]
[[Category:Most used Icelandic verbs]]

